  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Hatchling Cryo experiments gone wrong left Duster with heightened senses but a constantly fluctuating body temperature. He saw his flock wiped out by a DRIP raiding party, and now seeks revenge on all those who hoard the precious resource. His vigilante plague doctor mask hides a burning desire for vengeance… and a chronic case of the sniffles.",
    "class": "Plague Punk Hacker",
    "name": "Duster",
